  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s2",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nemo miles ad bellum cum deliciis venit nec de cubiculo ad aciem procedit, sed de papilionibus expeditis et substrictis, ubi omnis duritia et inbonitas et insuavitas constitit.",
    "chunk_index": 34,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s3",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Etiam in pace labore et incommodis bellum pati iam ediscunt in armis deambulando, campum decurrendo, fossam moliendo, testudinem destinando, desudando.",
    "chunk_index": 35,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s4",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sudore omnia constant, ne corpora atque animi expavescant de umbra ad solem et sole ad gelum, de tunica ad loricam, de silentio ad clamorem, de quiete ad tumultum.",
    "chunk_index": 36,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s5",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Proinde vos, benedicti, quodcunque hoc durum est, ad exercitationem virtutum animi et corporis deputate.",
    "chunk_index": 37,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s6",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Bonum agonem subituri estis, in quo agonothetes deus vivus est, xystarches spiritus sanctus, corona aeternitatis brabium angelicae substantiae, politia in caelis, gloria in saecula saeculorum.",
    "chunk_index": 38,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s7",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Itaque epistates vester Christus Iesus, qui vos spiritu unxit et ad hoc scamma produxit, voluit vos ante diem agonis ad duriorem tractationem a liberiore condicione seponere, ut vires corroborarentur in vobis.",
    "chunk_index": 39,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s8",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nempe enim et athletae segregantur ad strietiorem disciplinam, ut robori aedificando vacent.",
    "chunk_index": 40,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s9",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Continentur a luxuria, a cibis laetioribus, a potu iocundiore, coguntur, cruciantur, fatigantur:",
    "chunk_index": 41,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s10",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "quanto plus in exercitationibus laboraverint, tanto plus de victoria sperant. Et illi, inquit apostolus, ut coronam corruptibilem consequantur.",
    "chunk_index": 42,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.3.s11",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.3.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nos aeternam consecuturi carcerem nobis pro palaestra interpretamur, ut ad stadium tribunalis bene exercitati incommodis omnibus producamur, quia virtus duritia extruitur, mollitia vero destruitur.",
    "chunk_index": 43,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s1",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Scimus ex dominico praecepto, quod caro infirma sit, spiritus promptus. Non ergo nobis blandiamur, quia dominus consensit carnem infirmam esse.",
    "chunk_index": 44,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s2",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Propterea enim praedixit spiritum promptum, ut ostenderet, quid cui debeat esse subiectum, scilicet ut caro serviat spiritui, infirmior fortiori, ut ab eo etiam ipsa fortitudinem assumat.",
    "chunk_index": 45,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s3",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s3",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Colloquatur spiritus cum carne de communi salute, nec iam de incommodis carceris, sed ipso agone et proelio cogitans.",
    "chunk_index": 46,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s4",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s4",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Timebit forsitan caro gladium gravem et crucem excelsam et rabiem bestiarum et summam ignium poenam et omne carnificis ingenium in tormentis,",
    "chunk_index": 47,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s5",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s5",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "sed spiritus contraponat sibi et carni acerba licet ista, a multis tamen aequo animo excepta, immo et ultro appetita,",
    "chunk_index": 48,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s6",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "famae et gloriae causa nec a viris tantum, sed etiam a feminis, ut vos quoque, benedictae, sexui vestro respondeatis.",
    "chunk_index": 49,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s7",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s7",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Longum est, si enumerem singulos, qui se gladio confecerint animo suo ducti. De feminis ad manum est.",
    "chunk_index": 50,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s8",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s8",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Lucretia, quae vim stupri passa est, cultrum sibi adegit in conspectu propinquorum, ut gloriam castitati suae pareret.",
    "chunk_index": 51,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s9",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s9",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Mucius manum suam dexteram in ara cremavit, ut hoc factum eius fama haberet.",
    "chunk_index": 52,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s10",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Minus fecerunt philosophi Heraclitus, qui se bubulo stercore oblitum exussit, item Empedocles, qui in ignes Aetnaei montis desilivit,",
    "chunk_index": 53,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s11",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et Peregrinus, qui non olim se rogo immisit, cum feminae quoque contempserint ignes Dido, cum post virum dilectissimum nubere cogeretur,",
    "chunk_index": 54,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s12",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "item Asdrubalis uxor, quae iam ardente Carthagine, ne maritum suum supplicem Scipionis videret, cum filiis suis in incendium patriae devolavit.",
    "chunk_index": 55,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s13",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Regulus, dux Romanorum, captus a Carthaginiensibus, cum se unum pro multis captivis Carthaginiensibus compensari noluisset, maluit hostibus reddi et in arcae genus stipatus undique extrinsecus clavis transfixus tot cruces sensit.",
    "chunk_index": 56,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s14",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s14",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Bestias femina libens appetiit, et utique horridiores aspides serpentes tauro vel urso, quas Cleopatra immisit sibi, ne in manus inimici perveniret.",
    "chunk_index": 57,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s15",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s15",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Sed mortis metus non tantus est, quantus tormentorum. Itaque cessit carnifici meretrix Atheniensis, quae conscia coniurationis cum propterea torqueretur a tyranno,",
    "chunk_index": 58,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s16",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s16",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "et non prodidit coniuratos et novissime linguam suam commestam in faciem tyran(??)i expuit, ut nihil agere in se sciret tormenta, etsi ultra perseverarent.",
    "chunk_index": 59,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s17",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s17",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Nam quod hodie apud Lacedaemonas sollemnitas maxima est διαμαστίγι(??)σις, id est flagellatio, non latet.",
    "chunk_index": 60,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s18",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s18",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In quo sacro ante aram nobiles quique adulescentes flagellis affliguntur, astantibus parentibus et propinquis et, uti perseverent, adhertantibus.",
    "chunk_index": 61,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s19",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s19",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Ornamentum enim et gloria deputabitur maiore quidem titulo, si anima potius cesserit plagis, quam corpus.",
    "chunk_index": 62,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s20",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s20",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Igitur si tantum terrenae gloriae licet de corporis et animi vigore, ut gladium, ignem, crucem, bestias,",
    "chunk_index": 63,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s21",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s21",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "tormenta contemnat sub praemio laudis hum(??)ae, possum dicere, modicae sunt istae passiones ad consecutionem gloriae caelestis et divinae mercedis.",
    "chunk_index": 64,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.4.s22",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.4.s22",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Tanti vitreum, quanti verum margaritum? Quis ergo non libentissime tantum pro vero habeat erogare, quantum alii pro falso?",
    "chunk_index": 65,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1#stoa0275.stoa001.5.s1",
    "work_id": "perseus/stoa0275/stoa001/opp-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "stoa0275.stoa001.5.s1",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Omitto nunc gloriae causam. Eadem omnia saevitiae et cruciatus certamina iam apud homines affectatio quoque et morbus quidam animi conculcavit.",
    "chunk_index": 66,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": null,
    "date_range": null,
    "date_confidence": "uncertain",
    "out_of_period": false,
